    "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553650/extras/3f242bc08058d7aa24843e4b505b3ac8.avif?t=1753459224\" data-has-big width=800 height=376 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553650/extras/9b6cfd28ed92237479f9d9badf670685.avif?t=1753459224\" data-has-big width=800 height=128 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553650/extras/e13f1b9885f63a348d7c9c10a40b0e4a.poster.avif?t=1753459224\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553650/extras/e13f1b9885f63a348d7c9c10a40b0e4a.webp?t=1753459224\" class=\"bb_img\" width=609 height=174 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create Unstoppable Weapons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In <strong>Dream Slayers</strong>, power is earned through what you find and how you forge it. Discover powerful weapons in the <strong>Dream World</strong>, then <strong>enhance</strong> and <strong>customize</strong> them to suit your style. Enchant gear, refine stats, and build a loadout that evolves with every raid.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553650/extras/ed94b78740f4fbcca704326cb7e0d01a.avif?t=1753459224\" data-has-big width=800 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553650/extras/6bedc2e6d27dfe3e486b9990e58034d7.poster.avif?t=1753459224\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553650/extras/6bedc2e6d27dfe3e486b9990e58034d7.webp?t=1753459224\" class=\"bb_img\" width=609 height=174 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enhance The Arsenal\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In <strong>Dream Slayers</strong>, extraction is survival. Venture into the <strong>Dream World</strong> to claim <strong>rare relics</strong> and <strong>arcane loot</strong>\u00a0but the deeper you go, the deadlier it gets. Time your escape, trust your instincts, and remember: only what you extract becomes real.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553650/extras/26f12790e6cd699627aaf917b618ffb6.avif?t=1753459224\" data-has-big width=800 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553650/extras/73c8a8c7456249dfd1d00f979a82ad14.poster.avif?t=1753459224\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553650/extras/73c8a8c7456249dfd1d00f979a82ad14.webp?t=1753459224\" class=\"bb_img\" width=609 height=174 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take Down The Darkness</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In <strong>Dream Slayers</strong>, Nightmares are more than enemies, they're the echoes of fear, regret, and chaos. Face <strong>cursed knights</strong> and <strong>shifting beasts</strong>, each more twisted than the last. Conquer the darkness to uncover the truth\u2026 or be consumed by it.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553650/extras/596b31d4d56f605156fd3e84141e91f1.avif?t=1753459224\" data-has-big width=800 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553650/extras/7da72abf44776d9bb1a5f371e60b7863.poster.avif?t=1753459224\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553650/extras/7da72abf44776d9bb1a5f371e60b7863.webp?t=1753459224\" class=\"bb_img\" width=609 height=174 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rally Your Army\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The <strong>Dream World</strong> is brutal, don\u2019t face it alone. In <strong>Dream Slayers</strong>, you and your squad fight to <strong>survive</strong> and <strong>build a legacy</strong>. With up to four slayers, Team up, combine skills, and watch each other\u2019s backs. With the right allies, even the impossible becomes possible.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553650/extras/9b6cfd28ed92237479f9d9badf670685.avif?t=1753459224\" data-has-big width=800 height=128 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553650/extras/e13f1b9885f63a348d7c9c10a40b0e4a.poster.avif?t=1753459224\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553650/extras/e13f1b9885f63a348d7c9c10a40b0e4a.webp?t=1753459224\" class=\"bb_img\" width=609 height=174 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create Unstoppable Weapons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In <strong>Dream Slayers</strong>, power is earned through what you find and how you forge it. Discover powerful weapons in the <strong>Dream World</strong>, then <strong>enhance</strong> and <strong>customize</strong> them to suit your style. Enchant gear, refine stats, and build a loadout that evolves with every raid.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553650/extras/ed94b78740f4fbcca704326cb7e0d01a.avif?t=1753459224\" data-has-big width=800 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553650/extras/6bedc2e6d27dfe3e486b9990e58034d7.poster.avif?t=1753459224\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553650/extras/6bedc2e6d27dfe3e486b9990e58034d7.webp?t=1753459224\" class=\"bb_img\" width=609 height=174 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enhance The Arsenal\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In <strong>Dream Slayers</strong>, extraction is survival. Venture into the <strong>Dream World</strong> to claim <strong>rare relics</strong> and <strong>arcane loot</strong>\u00a0but the deeper you go, the deadlier it gets. Time your escape, trust your instincts, and remember: only what you extract becomes real.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553650/extras/26f12790e6cd699627aaf917b618ffb6.avif?t=1753459224\" data-has-big width=800 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553650/extras/73c8a8c7456249dfd1d00f979a82ad14.poster.avif?t=1753459224\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553650/extras/73c8a8c7456249dfd1d00f979a82ad14.webp?t=1753459224\" class=\"bb_img\" width=609 height=174 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take Down The Darkness</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In <strong>Dream Slayers</strong>, Nightmares are more than enemies, they're the echoes of fear, regret, and chaos. Face <strong>cursed knights</strong> and <strong>shifting beasts</strong>, each more twisted than the last. Conquer the darkness to uncover the truth\u2026 or be consumed by it.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553650/extras/596b31d4d56f605156fd3e84141e91f1.avif?t=1753459224\" data-has-big width=800 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553650/extras/7da72abf44776d9bb1a5f371e60b7863.poster.avif?t=1753459224\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553650/extras/7da72abf44776d9bb1a5f371e60b7863.webp?t=1753459224\" class=\"bb_img\" width=609 height=174 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rally Your Army\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The <strong>Dream World</strong> is brutal, don\u2019t face it alone. In <strong>Dream Slayers</strong>, you and your squad fight to <strong>survive</strong> and <strong>build a legacy</strong>. With up to four slayers, Team up, combine skills, and watch each other\u2019s backs. With the right allies, even the impossible becomes possible.</i></p>",
